## Phase 1 — Validate and preserve return targets

**Goal:** [02-post-login-return-page.md](./02-post-login-return-page.md) — parsers keep deep links; reject unsafe URLs.

**Exit criteria:** Unit tests prove path retention + allowlist rejection; validated value keeps `/some/deep` for allowlisted website URLs.

| Task | Paths / detail |
|------|----------------|
| Fix `parseWebsiteReturnUrl` | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/auth/utils/websiteConfig.ts` — keep pathname + search; `null` when invalid |
| Core return path helper | Same auth utils (or LoginPage-local) — path must start with `/`; reject `/login`, `/callback` loops; reject absolute foreign URLs |
| Optional platform-nav align | `packages/platform-nav/src/returnUrl.ts` — reuse `parseReturnUrl` patterns if it reduces duplication |
| Unit tests | Allowlisted deep URL kept; foreign host rejected; malformed rejected |

**Verify (future implement):** `npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root` · platform-nav tests if package changed

---

## Phase 2 — Wire login host + capture call sites

**Goal:** [02-post-login-return-page.md](./02-post-login-return-page.md) — post-login restore; guests capture page before login.

**Exit criteria:** Google and email/password both restore the requested page; invalid return → homepage.

| Task | Paths / detail |
|------|----------------|
| Login host | `LoginPage.tsx`, `IdentityLoginFrame.tsx` — pass validated website URL and/or core `returnPath` (remove hardcoded `/`-only when valid target exists) |
| Post-login restore | `useIdentityAuthMessage.ts`, `WebsiteReturnRedirect.tsx` — auth-code to **full** website URL; `navigate(returnPath)` for core |
| Website CTAs | `website/frontend/src/features/webonone/utils/webononeConfig.ts` + booking / contact / protected-action call sites → `getWebOnOneLoginUrl(currentPage)` |
| WebOnOne guards | Routes that send guests to `/login` attach return path |
| Session gate | If choose-account / role gate runs ([1.13.1](../1.13.1/README.md)), apply return navigation **after** gate completes |

**Verify (future implement):** type-check webonone + website; manual acceptance in [07](./07-implementation-plan.md)

