## Risks and open items

- **Account / role gate** — Do not navigate away before session gate finishes when it is shown.
- **Silent SSO** — Already-authenticated `/login?return_url=…` must use full URL via `WebsiteReturnRedirect`.
- **Multi-origin allowlist** — Only exact allowlisted origin match is valid.
- **Open redirect** — Never accept non-allowlisted hosts; never put tokens in return URL.

---

## Do not

- Strip website `return_url` to origin root
- Always `navigate('/')` after iframe success when a valid return exists
- Put JWT/password in return URL
- Accept cross-origin returns outside the website allowlist
- Change Identity Google / email login UI for this spec

---

